Description: Present Kopper stereo eyes through the packed X11 pixmap route
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: other, Sparky Stereo OS
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-01

Keep GPU eye resources separate from the native-window Vulkan swapchain.
Pack and upload both eyes through the existing X11 Present loader, declaring
only the resulting stereo image. Invalidate offscreen attachments on viewport
resize and preserve the declaration across GLX-only drawable recreation.

Assisted-by: gpt-6-astra via Codex

